{"seq":14,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:55:36.664Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5ecbf35f10418a26c1b9b64d9e19e0e8b8641fca8f5f35ebf080cd9865bbb997","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests show (latest 9/30/2026):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until it changed hands on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 Sunday prep says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the CRM reassignment was effective 2026-05-04.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato (\"Gideon's fleet account\"). The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day. Earlier digests from 2025 already call it Gideon's, so the 5/4 wording is unclear.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The digests only say \"Gideon's medical account\" (12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026), but Orlavine is the only medical account. A 3/2025 digest had it as Nadia's, so it changed at some point. No digest gives the date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. They only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia is hosting a QFO training session, but that doesn't show she owns the account. I'd confirm this one with Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the board slide.\n\nMoss's digests are the only source for this. I couldn't see any CRM or account files to cross-check.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:55:41.015Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7f2e886e1f2e7adecc35da9dccf67346fe684e873c53cec46058ef3caa10560b","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Ownership comes only from Moss's digests, and I couldn't see any CRM or account files to cross-check.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands from Nadia Fennimore on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 and 5/4 digests both give that date.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" that day. Digests from 2025 already call it his, so that wording is unclear.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon. The digests only say \"Gideon's medical account\", and a 3/2025 digest had it as Nadia's. No digest gives the date it changed.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** No owner is named in any digest. I told Ruth to confirm with Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the board slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
